      "widgets_values": [
        "Full Qwen rewriter: quick start.\n\nThe 9B FL2VA Q5_K_M model and its F16 vision projector download on first run (about 7.39 GB together).\n\nThis example disables thinking for a short run. The node default enables it.\n\nFor I2VA/L2VA/FL2VA, connect Picture frames in chip order. For reference scenes, choose a Ref2VA checkpoint and connect IMAGE, VIDEO or decoded RefMod inputs. Sound needs an explicit description.\n\nSetup: docs/qwen_rewriter.md"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Full Qwen rewriter: quick start.\n\nThe 9B FL2VA Q5_K_M model and its F16 vision projector download on first run (about 7.39 GB together).\n\nThis example disables thinking for a short run. The node default enables it.\n\nFor I2VA/L2VA/FL2VA, connect Picture frames in chip order. For reference scenes, choose a Ref2VA checkpoint and connect IMAGE, VIDEO or decoded RefMod inputs. Sound needs an explicit description.\n\nSetup: docs/qwen_rewriter.md"
      },
